e publier un exemple. Amélioration proposée : un scénario ciblé contrôlant cette correspondance dans l’exemple de sg-help ; proposition uniquement.\n\nSuite : si une correction est demandée, établir d’abord le propriétaire attendu et reproduire le scénario. Le présent scope reste limité à ce constat synthétique ; aucun chantier ni changement n’est engagé.","id":"delivery-42","provider_delivery":"unknown","sequence":42,"type":"response"},{"capture_boundary":"broker_stdout_or_coordinator_release","concrete_checkpoint_declared":true,"id":"delivery-43","kind":"Rapport de l’audit synthétique skills/sg-help enregistré, avec un finding review, preuves simulées et limites explicites, sans modification ni trace de chantier","protocol_placeholder_fields":[],"provider_delivery":"unknown","sequence":43,"type":"checkpoint"}],"real_subject_observation":true,"refusals":[{"boundary":"mcp_transport","error_sha256":"9ed30738ebeeb18edd572c92bb50ceb06f9bde525f82c80c1a2020074419d731","provider_delivery":"unknown","request_sha256":"79882ed06859e52e893d4ce9fa79dfa96ea274818e7fb9ef9ebef0a329a76a6c"}],"requests":29,"response_evidence":[{"capture_authentication":"not_verified","content_sha256":"1dd36e5a1eb9d52937d70bc1bb12c4dd5729f80352f094663d7b46fd7a641906","event_id":"delivery-29"},{"capture_authentication":"not_verified","content_sha256":"5ec6c8e680a3f71c58f36742fbbce1ed5c8b140ba92d0f16c8ba3e37cf71e277","event_id":"delivery-42"}],"response_sensitive_matches":[[],[]],"run_id":"native-shared-final96-A1-r2-baseline","sealed":true,"started_ns":1791359946826615200,"strict_isolated_pilot_eligible":false,"subject_id":"/root/source_review/final_subject_016","timing_boundary":"preparation_to_coordinator_finalize_only","variant":"baseline"}